<title>POLAND: POLISA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 7.0.</title>
<headline>POLISA TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 7.0.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 77,000 shares in Polisa SA at seven zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Polisa was trading at 6.7 zlotys in 9,312 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
